      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener API. It uses chi 5.2.1 and PostgreSQL, applies the required table setup at startup, preserves click counts across restarts, and lists links in creation order. `start.sh` runs the server in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`; startup instructions are in the README.\n\nVerified with `go test ./...`, `go vet ./...`, and `git diff --check`. The PostgreSQL-backed HTTP behavior wasn’t exercised against a running database.",
